{"articleNo":"305859","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=305859&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [국제] 2021년 1학기 교내 모의토익시험 일정 안내(일반인 응시 불가)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.03.29","hit":"12980","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2021년 1학기 교내 모의토익시험 일정을 아래와 같이 안내합니다.</span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. </span><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시험일자</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">코로나 19 상황에 따라 시험일정은 조정되거나 취소될 수 있음)</span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1차 시험일시: 2021. 05. 07.(금), 18시 10분까지 입실완료하여야 함</span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2차 시험일시: 2021. 05. 21.(금), </strong><strong>18시 10분까지 입실완료하여야 함</strong></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">접수기간 및 기타 상세 일정은 추후 공지 예정</span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항 </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">및 기타 안내</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><font face=\"Thread-00005110-Id-000000f5\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가. </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">코로나 19확산에 따라 교내 모의토익&nbsp; 시험은 &nbsp;취소 또는 연기될 수 있습니다.</span></strong></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><font face=\"Thread-00005110-Id-000000f5\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 교내 성적장학금 등의 사유로 어학성적이 필요한 학생은 사전에 공인어학성적을 취득하여 대비하시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><font face=\"Thread-00005110-Id-000000f5\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> 나